  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Future of Recycling Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Center for Digital Inclusion Amzonia (CDI), $175,420 over 18 months CDI Amaznia will offer hands-on training in refurbishing computers, build upon its campaign to promote awareness of e-waste, add more e-waste collection points and develop its enterprise that sells reconditioned computers. It will work with CDI Par to introduce similar training, an awareness campaign and courses on recycling e-waste into handicrafts. Activities will benefit 480 people directly and 1,050 indirectly.</narrative>
  </description>
